@startuml
title P2 Acceptance - Evidence and Dependency Map

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "Upstream implementation stories" {
  [P2 codec spike\nfixtures + memory ceilings] as Codec
  [P2 streamed tracks\nB1 regressions + rollout notes] as Tracks
  [P2 Air rooms\nB2-B4 regressions + load basis] as Air
  [P2 targets + inbox\nB5-B7 regressions + rights notes] as Targets
  [P1 compliance baseline\ncontent policy + reporting] as Compliance
}

rectangle "P2 acceptance story" {
  [Gate matrix + lab roster] as Matrix
  [Observability + quota views] as Metrics
  [B1 platform matrix] as B1
  [B2-B4 Air + scale proof] as B24
  [B5-B7 rights + mixed fleet proof] as B57
  [Rollout + rollback rehearsal] as Rollback
  [7-day beta + quota calibration] as Beta
  [Promotion packet + evidence index] as Packet
}

Codec --> Matrix
Codec --> Metrics
Tracks --> B1
Tracks --> B24
Tracks --> B57
Tracks --> Rollback
Tracks --> Beta
Air --> B24
Air --> Rollback
Targets --> B57
Targets --> Rollback
Compliance --> B57
Compliance --> Packet

Matrix --> Metrics
Matrix --> B1
Matrix --> B24
Matrix --> B57
Metrics --> B1
Metrics --> B24
Metrics --> B57
Metrics --> Beta
B1 --> Beta
B24 --> Beta
B57 --> Beta
Rollback --> Beta
B1 --> Packet
B24 --> Packet
B57 --> Packet
Rollback --> Packet
Beta --> Packet

note bottom of Packet
Final packet maps every artifact to:
- B1-B7
- 20.5 non-functional gates
- 20.6 seven-day beta gate
- 18 rollout and rollback order
end note

@enduml
